flowchart TB
    accTitle: A question of an agent
    accDescr: An agent of Dennis, such as an orchestrator on his PC, sends the event pager-ask with gh to the private control repository, with an id, a question and two to four options. Its workflow takes only an event of Dennis himself, checks it and sends it to the Worker, signed. The pager opens a topic for the question, with one button per option. Dennis presses one, and the GitHub App saves his answer as answers/id.json on the branch pager-answers of the control repository. The agent reads it there with gh, without a secret of its own.

    agent["`**An agent of Dennis** sends pager-ask with gh: an id, a question and its options`"]
    control["`**The workflow of the control repository** takes only Dennis's own events and sends it on, signed`"]
    topic["`**🤔 A topic of its own** in Telegram, with one button per option`"]
    press["Dennis presses an option"]
    saved["`**answers/id.json** on the branch pager-answers, saved by the GitHub App`"]
    read["The agent reads the answer with gh"]

    agent --> control --> topic --> press --> saved --> read

    classDef you fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class agent,press you
    class control,topic bot
